/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0.196 0.275 0.263 rg
58.1102362204724443 712.0632283464566399 Td
(Generic EMRs are built for general physicians \(fever, BP, diabetes\) and feel cluttered for skin clinics. Cliniq is purpose-built) Tj
T* (for Dermatology & Aesthetics: visual lesion tracking, Day 0 vs Day 14 photo comparisons, procedure vs consultation) Tj
T* (revenue split, and AI skin triage.) Tj
