(Q: Why do we cap AI scans and sell Top-Up packs instead of making AI unlimited for free?) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0.196 0.275 0.263 rg
58.1102362204724443 650.8348818897637784 Td
(Every high-resolution AI skin image analysis costs us cloud compute. By giving 5 free trial scans, bundling 150 scans in) Tj
T* (Clinic Pro \(Rs. 3,999/mo\), and charging Rs. 999 per 100 extra scans, our gross margins stay above 80% even when a) Tj
T* (clinic scans 50 patients a day.) Tj
